    cp /etc/issue /etc/motd

    whiptail --title "Sucesso / Success" --msgbox "[POR] Instalação concluída com sucesso!\n\nStaff: http://${IP_REAL}:8080\nOPAC:  http://${IP_REAL}:80\nUsuário: $DB_USER | Senha: $DB_PASS\nPainel: sudo options.sh\n\nNUVEM (GOOGLE DRIVE / OUTROS):\nPara configurar backups automáticos em nuvem, use a Opção 7 do painel.\nDocumentação oficial do Google Drive no Rclone: https://rclone.org/drive/\n--------------------------------------------------\n[EN] Installation completed successfully!\n\nStaff URL: http://${IP_REAL}:8080\nOPAC URL:  http://${IP_REAL}:80\nUser: $DB_USER | Password: $DB_PASS\nDashboard: sudo options.sh\n\nCLOUD (GOOGLE DRIVE / OTHERS):\nTo configure automated cloud backups, select Option 7 from the dashboard.\nOfficial Google Drive documentation in Rclone: https://rclone.org/drive/" 20 78
